      "body": "It appears that they link to a privacy policy page from Login and AccountCreation.\r\n\r\n```\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java-198-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java-199-\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java:200:    public void showPrivacyPolicy(View v) {\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java:201:        FeedbackUtil.showPrivacyPolicy(this);\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java-202-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/createaccount/CreateAccountActivity.java-203-\r\n--\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java-122-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java-123-\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java:124:    public void showPrivacyPolicy(View v) {\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java:125:        FeedbackUtil.showPrivacyPolicy(this);\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java-126-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/login/LoginActivity.java-127-\r\n--\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java-91-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java-92-\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java:93:    public static void showPrivacyPolicy(Context context) {\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java:94:        visitInExternalBrowser(context, Uri.parse(context.getString(R.string.privacy_policy_url)));\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java-95-    }\r\napp/src/main/java/org/wikipedia/util/FeedbackUtil.java-96-\r\n\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-83-\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-84-            <TextView\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml:85:                android:id=\"@+id/privacy_policy_link\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-86-                android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-87-                android:layout_height=\"wrap_content\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-88-                android:layout_gravity=\"bottom|center_horizontal\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-89-                android:padding=\"8dp\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml:90:                android:text=\"@string/privacy_policy_description\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-91-                android:textAppearance=\"?android:attr/textAppearanceSmall\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-92-                android:textColor=\"?attr/link_color\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-93-                android:clickable=\"true\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml:94:                android:onClick=\"showPrivacyPolicy\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-95-                />\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_create_account.xml-96-\r\n--\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-52-\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-53-        <TextView\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml:54:            android:id=\"@+id/privacy_policy_link\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-55-            android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-56-            android:layout_height=\"wrap_content\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-57-            android:layout_gravity=\"bottom|center_horizontal\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-58-            android:padding=\"8dp\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml:59:            android:text=\"@string/privacy_policy_description\"\r\napp/src/main/res/layout/activity_wiki_login.xml-60-          